menu "hassctrl web server"

    config HC_WEB_FIRMWARE_ROUTES
        bool "API of the firmware's pages"
        default y
        help
            The routes only the main firmware serves: Home Assistant, dashboard, backup, camera,
            player and time (/api/hass, /api/dashboard, /api/backup, /api/camera, /api/player,
            /api/time). Off in the recovery app (sdkconfig.recovery), which has none of these;
            its web pages answer the 404 with "not in the recovery app". The time routes alone
            bring the time zone table and SNTP into the image.

endmenu
